<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 10 discount T-bill issues this wk.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 10 discount T-bill issues this wk.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 10 discount T-bill issues with no minimum acceptable prices set in advance and a total par value of 180 billion levs at auctions this week, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Five issues will have a maturity of one week and a par value of eight billion levs each and the other five will have a four-week maturity and par values of 28 billion levs each.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER     AUCTION DATE     ISSUE DATE    MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG3034897002	   May 19	    May 20	   May 27</p>
<p> BG3034997000	   May 19	    May 20	   June 17</p>
<p> BG3035097008	   May 20	    May 21	   May 28</p>
<p> BG3035197006	   May 20	    May 21	   June 18</p>
<p> BG3035297004	   May 21	    May 22	   May 29</p>
<p> BG3035397002	   May 21	    May 22	   June 19</p>
<p> BG3035497000	   May 22	    May 23	   May 30</p>
<p> BG3035597007	   May 22	    May 23	   June 20</p>
<p> BG3035697005	   May 23	    May 26	   June 2</p>
<p> BG3035797003	   May 23	    May 26	   June 23</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
